WEBVTT

00:00:00.800 --> 00:00:02.862
This is you! And you've got a problem.

00:00:05.200 --> 00:00:07.618
The same excel report, again and again.

00:00:07.800 --> 00:00:08.865
There's a better way!

00:00:11.700 --> 00:00:13.338
You're free on weekday evenings.

00:00:14.000 --> 00:00:15.440
You look for people nearby.

00:00:17.100 --> 00:00:18.336
They know what you don't!

00:00:18.336 --> 00:00:19.818
Everybody's good at something.

00:00:21.200 --> 00:00:22.124
A group of five!

00:00:22.124 --> 00:00:23.741
Small enough to really talk.

00:00:29.200 --> 00:00:31.717
With three or four, you can agree to start sooner.

00:00:33.000 --> 00:00:33.943
Time to meet!

00:00:35.900 --> 00:00:37.043
Learn from each other!

00:00:41.000 --> 00:00:43.477
Kvintet finds the time when everyone is free!

00:00:44.800 --> 00:00:46.058
No back and forth.

00:00:46.800 --> 00:00:48.584
Plan details in the group chat.

00:00:52.700 --> 00:00:53.796
Problem solved.

00:00:59.400 --> 00:01:01.210
Kvintet. Come find your five!

